OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and windy start on
OL,6,FTuesday with outbreaks of rain through
OL,7,Fthe morning, sometimes heavy. Turning
OL,8,Fdrier later with a scattering of
OL,9,Fshowers and some bright spells. A
OL,10,Fmilder day than yesterday, but breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA few showers persisting this
OL,13,Fevening but most places dry. Further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain arriving overnight,
OL,15,Fturning heavy at times and milder than
OL,16,Frecent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
