OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAnother mixed day with
OL,6,Foccasional sunny intervals and
OL,7,Fshowers. These heavy at times, with
OL,8,Fthe risk of thunder. Temperatures
OL,9,Fclose to average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FShowery outbreaks of rain clearing
OL,13,Fthrough Thursday. Turning drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter on Friday and into Saturday.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average with frost
OL,16,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
